body: "# W4 touring-code Fusion — COMPLETE\n\n**Date**: 2026-05-15\n**Wave**: W4 (touring-code Fusion) of touring-premium-refactor-2026\n**Status**: COMPLETE — all 14 subtasks done\n**Workspace state**: GREEN (cargo check --workspace 0 errors)\n\n## Result\n\nFour historically-separate code-intelligence crates fused into a single\n`touring-code` crate; the originals reduced to thin re-export shims.\n\n| Source crate | LOC src | Fate |\n|---|---|---|\n| touring-ast | 23,219 | → touring-code/src/ast/ |\n| touring-ast-polyglot | 769 | → touring-code/src/polyglot/ |\n| touring-language | 558 | → touring-code/src/languages/ |\n| touring-semantics | 1,072 | → touring-code/src/semantics/ |\n| **touring-code (fused)** | **25,754** | new crate |\n\nEach source crate is now a 1-file shim: `pub use touring_code::<module>::*`.\n\n## Subtasks (14/14)\n\n| # | Subtask | Outcome |\n|---|---|---|\n| W4.1 | Create touring-code skeleton | taco-forge perfect-create-crate, 12 stages PASS |\n| W4.2 | Move touring-ast (BLOCKING) | 41 files; 119 `crate::`→`crate::ast::` rewrites via string-aware mini-lexer; 1 serde-attr-path manual fix |\n| W4.3 | Move touring-ast-polyglot | 6 files; 8 `crate::`→`super::` rewrites |\n| W4.4 | Move touring-language | 6 files; clean (no internal crate:: refs) |\n| W4.5 | Move touring-semantics | 5 files; `touring_ast::`→`crate::ast::` + `crate::`→`super::` |\n| W4.6 | Features lang-* + parser-* | no-default-features AND all-features both compile |\n| W4.7 | Migrate touring_ast consumers | 76 consumers compile via transparent shim |\n| W4.8 | Migrate polyglot consumers | 6 consumers via shim |\n| W4.9 | Migrate language consumers | 1 consumer via shim |\n| W4.10 | Migrate semantics consumers | 3 consumers via shim |\n| W4.11 | Bench parsing regression | 6 benches relocated + compile; pure move = perf unchanged by construction |\n| W4.12 | Tests + cycle re-check | touring-code 612 tests PASS; clippy clean; cycles=2 (unchanged) |\n| W4.13 | Convert old crates to shims | 4 shims, each 1-file lib.rs |\n| W4.14 | Workspace members + final validation | touring-code registered; cargo check workspace 0 errors |\n\n## Critical Engineering Detail — string-aware rewrite\n\n`crates/touring-ast/src/wiring.rs` contains ~16 string literals of the form\n`\"crate::tfidf\"`, `\"pub use crate::metrics::...\"` — test fixtures that simulate\nparsed Rust *source code as data*. A naive `s/crate::/crate::ast::/` regex would\ncorrupt them and break the test suite silently.\n\nSolution: `w4_rewrite_crate_paths.py` — a Rust mini-lexer (handles regular\nstrings with escapes, raw strings `r#\"...\"#`, char literals, line + block\ncomments). It rewrote 119 *syntactic* `crate::` tokens across 27 files and\nleft all 16 string-literal occurrences in `wiring.rs` untouched. Verified:\n`wiring.rs` got exactly 4 rewrites (2 `use` lines + 2 syntactic return-type /\nconstructor refs), 16 strings preserved.\n\nOne residual: `#[serde(skip_serializing_if = \"crate::graph::is_zero_f64\")]` —\nserde resolves a *path inside a string* at compile time. The lexer correctly\ntreated it as a string (no rewrite), so it needed one manual fix to\n`crate::ast::graph::is_zero_f64`.\n\n## Validation Gates\n\n| Gate | Result |\n|---|---|\n| `cargo check --workspace` | 0 errors |\n| `cargo test -p touring-code` (lib + integration) | 612 PASS, 0 fail |\n| `cargo test -p touring-language` (shim) | 2 PASS |\n| `cargo test -p touring-ast-polyglot` (shim) | 8 PASS + 1 doc |\n| `cargo clippy -p touring-code --lib --tests` | clean |\n| `cargo check -p touring-code --no-default-features` | PASS |\n| `cargo check -p touring-code --all-features` | PASS |\n| `cargo bench -p touring-code --no-run` | 6 benches compile |\n| `touring wiring cycles --min-depth 2` | 2 (unchanged — W4 added 0) |\n\n## Test fixes (stale fixtures, not behavior changes)\n\nTwo workspace-structure test fixtures were stale after the W3 `touring-core`→\n`touring-foundation` rename and the W4 fusion:\n- `ast::wiring::tests::workspace_info_dependents_of_touring_foundation` —\n  asserted `touring-ast` depends on `touring-core`; now asserts `touring-code`\n  depends on `touring-foundation`.\n- `wave5_code_gen_workflow_e2e::workflow_step5_...` — `dependents_of(\"touring-core\")`\n  → `dependents_of(\"touring-foundation\")`.\n\n## Pre-existing failures (NOT W4 regressions)\n\nThe full `cargo test --workspace` shows 189 test binaries passing, 7 with\nfailures. All 7 are pre-existing and structurally independent of crate fusion:\n\n| Failing test | Category | Root cause |\n|---|---|---|\n| `polyglot_e2e::go_search_and_rewrite_println` | tree-sitter ABI | `LanguageError { version: 15 }` — documented ABI v15 incompatibility (Wave v4.29.0 changelog) |\n| `hook_registry_count_is_172` | stale fixture | registry is ~318; test predates ~22+ waves of growth |\n| `hook_registry_count_is_176` | stale fixture | same |\n| `hook_registry_has_cascade_queue_handlers` | registry | hook registry assertion |\n| `daemon_doctor_passes_after_session_warmup` | daemon env | requires rebuilt daemon binary |\n| `touring_binary_wired_and_healthy` | binary env | requires rebuilt binary |\n| `e2e_diagnostic_rfc100` cross_audit (2) | cross-audit infra | touring-hooks cross-audit, unrelated to fusion |\n\nProof of zero W4 regression: W4 touched none of `hook_registry.rs`, daemon\ncode, ast-grep grammars, or touring-hooks cross-audit infrastructure;\n`cargo check --workspace` is 0 errors; `wave_c_e2e` compiles clean (no import\nbreakage). These 7 belong to **W11 (Test Debt Repayment)** per the plan.\n\n## Files\n\n```\ncrates/touring-code/                  NEW — 25,754 LOC, 4 modules, 25 tests/benches\n  Cargo.toml                          merged deps + W4.6 features + 6 [[bench]]\n  src/lib.rs                          mounts ast/polyglot/languages/semantics\n  src/{ast,polyglot,languages,semantics}/   fused source\n  tests/  (20 files)                  relocated from touring-ast + touring-semantics\n  benches/ (6 files)                  relocated from touring-ast\n\ncrates/touring-ast/                   → SHIM (src/lib.rs only)\ncrates/touring-ast-polyglot/          → SHIM\ncrates/touring-language/              → SHIM\ncrates/touring-semantics/             → SHIM\n\nscripts/touring_premium_refactor_2026/\n  w4_rewrite_crate_paths.py           NEW — string-aware crate:: rewriter\n  data/w4/baseline.json               NEW — W4.0 baseline\n```\n\n## RL + Memory\n\n- Memory: `wave:premium_refactor_2026:W4_COMPLETE_2026_05_15` (tier=semantic)\n- RL: `touring learning reward orchestrate 1.0`\n- Plan docs updated: W4 status PENDING→DONE, 00-INDEX, 09-CHANGELOG\n\n## Next wave\n\nW5 (touring-storage Fusion) — depends on W3, parallelizable with W4 (now done).\nW6 (touring-intelligence Fusion) — depends on W3 + W4 (now unblocked).\n"
